{"event": "turn", "session_id": "696a697b22b04409be371c8db102c350", "sequence": 1, "created_at": "2026-10-16T06:27:05.896059+00:00", "message": "绿茶冲泡水温是否必须固定为80摄氏度？", "resolved_question": "绿茶冲泡水温是否必须固定为80摄氏度？", "context_turns": 0, "model": "deepseek-flash", "thinking": "disabled", "config_revision": 3, "compliance_blocked": false, "elapsed_seconds": 36.017, "model_calls": 3, "input_tokens": 4907, "output_tokens": 382, "response": {"answer": "不是必须固定为80摄氏度。\n\n依据 ISO 20715:2023《Tea — Classification of tea types》中的冲泡说明：茶类只是冲泡的起点，并不规定统一的时间或温度；叶片等级、颗粒大小、品种、水质、投茶量和期望浓度都会影响萃取，建议按生产商说明并依口味调整，而不是假设同一套冲泡公式适用于所有茶。\n\n因此，绿茶冲泡水温没有“必须固定为80℃”的硬性规定。具体水温、时间等参数，本次工具证据未给出统一数值，无法进一步验证；如你手上有具体茶品，建议以该产品包装或商家说明为准。", "intent": "question_answering", "intents": ["question_answering"], "confidence": null, "intent_source": "model", "recommendations": [], "knowledge_sources": [{"title": "ISO 20715:2023 Tea — Classification of tea types", "url": "https://www.iso.org/obp/ui?_escaped_fragment_=iso%3Astd%3Aiso%3A20715%3Aed-1%3Av1%3Aen", "year": null}, {"title": "Fermentation: The Key Step in Processing of Black Tea", "url": "https://agris.fao.org/search/fr/records/6473b0a3542a3f9f03b31231", "year": null}, {"title": "Culture of Çay (tea), UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage", "url": "https://ich.unesco.org/en/RL/culture-of-cay-tea-a-symbol-of-identity-hospitality-and-social-interaction-01685?RL=01685", "year": null}, {"title": "Tea as a Symbol of Common Life and Culture in Anatolia, Go Türkiye", "url": "https://goturkiye.com/gastronomy/blog/tea-as-a-symbol-of-common-life-and-culture-in-anatolia", "year": null}], "memory_used": false, "clarification_required": false, "tasks": [{"id": "s1", "tool": "introduce_tea", "status": "success"}], "task_plan": {"steps": [{"id": "s1", "intent": "question_answering", "tool": "introduce_tea", "request": "绿茶冲泡水温是否必须固定为80摄氏度？", "depends_on": [], "product_from": null, "limit": 4, "recommendation": null, "knowledge_from": null, "tea_scope": []}], "output_order": ["s1"